  aciklama:
  - "Daha \xF6nce pek \xE7ok kez ikiye, hatta \xFC\xE7e ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F yollardan
    birini tercih etmek durumunda kalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Telvelerinin son k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131,
    ard\u0131nda b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n ve se\xE7medi\u011Fin yollardan dolay\u0131
    \"damar damar\" olmu\u015F {{isim}}. \xDCz\xFClerek vedala\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    e\u015Fini, \"bu yollar\u0131n en b\xFCy\xFC\u011F\xFC\" diye d\xFC\u015F\xFCnm\xFC\u015Ft\xFCn,
    \xF6yle de\u011Fil mi? Fakat do\u011Frusunu s\xF6ylemek gerekirse, o en b\xFCy\xFCk
    yolda hen\xFCz y\xFCr\xFCmemi\u015Fsin. Hayat yak\u0131nda kar\u015F\u0131na
    \xF6yle bir k\u0131smet \xE7\u0131kartacak ki, {{yas_0}} y\u0131ld\u0131r yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    t\xFCm ezberleri bozacaks\u0131n!"
